    question: 'What laptop bags are TSA-friendly?',
    answer: '<p><strong>TSA-friendly bags</strong> let you leave your laptop inside during security screening. Look for:</p><ul><li><strong>Checkpoint-friendly:</strong> Bag lies flat with laptop compartment separated from other items</li><li><strong>Clamshell opening:</strong> Opens like a suitcase for X-ray visibility</li><li><strong>Butterfly design:</strong> Laptop section unfolds completely flat</li></ul><p>Our top TSA-friendly picks: <strong>Nomatic Travel Pack</strong> (clamshell), <strong>Aer Travel Pack 3</strong> (checkpoint design), and <strong>Tortuga Outbreaker</strong> (full clamshell).</p><p><em>Note: TSA discretion varies. Even with a checkpoint bag, you may occasionally be asked to remove your laptop.</em></p>'
